      "date": "2026-08-12T20:30:01.000Z",
      "content": "\u2604\ufe0fNight owls, meteor fans, and sky watching enthusiasts, this one's for you!\n\nIn just a few hours, we will be hosting a Perseids meteor shower watch party live on YouTube!\n\nThroughout the broadcast, we will show real-time sky imagery from Marshall\u2019s Automated Lunar and Meteor Observatory (ALaMO). Plus, meteoroid experts from Marshall and guest experts will join us to discuss the science behind the Perseids and answer YOUR questions in real time.\n\nJoin us starting at 11 p.m. CT (12 a.m. ET) >> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kVRkkrB4eS0",
